### Teste de debug do logout
### Verificar se os endpoints estão funcionando

### 1. Testar se o FireBirdAPI está rodando
GET http://localhost:8000/api/Auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### 2. Testar endpoint de nós
GET http://localhost:8000/api/Auth/nodes
Authorization: Bearer SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### 3. Testar endpoint de logout
POST http://localhost:8000/api/Auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer SEU_TOKEN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Testar endpoint de unbind (se tiver um nó)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/Auth/unbind-node
Authorization: Bearer SEU_TOKEN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodeId": "SEU_NODE_ID_AQUI"
}
